@startuml
[*] --> queued
queued --> review : dispatch
review --> holding : pro runway @ peak
holding --> review : off-peak fires (job service)
review --> taxiing : cleared
review --> rejected : refused (human)
rejected --> [*]
taxiing --> airborne : context hydrated
airborne --> handed_off : crosses plane boundary
handed_off --> airborne : target pilot returns result
airborne --> landed : done
airborne --> failed : error / egress-refused
failed --> review : retry (human)
landed --> debriefed : .agent_learning appended
debriefed --> filed : ledger sealed
filed --> [*]
@enduml
